From 69d1089a1075c49ecba3d198df1e657f9a59fd7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:29:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Aperture: add a macro camera mode

aperture groups auxiliary cameras into the lens selector using zoom
ratios calculated from focal length. macro lenses do not fit this model
and should not appear as wide or telephoto steps in photo mode.

add a dedicated macro camera mode, read macro camera ids from an overlay
resource, and switch to the macro sensor when the mode is selected.

Change-Id: Iea0d34d8bb8a5314e23dfa564cd079e419262da2
